### 3. Repository 인터페이스 및 구현체

#### 3.1 MallRepository

**인터페이스** (`domain/proxy`):
```kotlin
interface MallRepository {
    fun getAllByIds(mallIds: List<Int>): List<MallProjection>
    fun putAll(malls: List<MallProjection>)
}
```

**구현체** (`outbound-adapter/proxy/MallRepositoryImpl.kt`):
```kotlin
@Component
class MallRepositoryImpl(
    private val mallValkeyRepository: MallValkeyRepository,
) : MallRepository,
    GlobalCache<Int, MallProjection> {

    override fun getAllByIds(mallIds: List<Int>): List<MallProjection> =
        mallValkeyRepository.getAll(mallIds)
            .mapNotNull { it?.toProjection() }

    override fun putAll(malls: List<MallProjection>) {
        mallValkeyRepository.putAll(malls.map { it.toEntity() })
    }

    override fun getAll(ids: Collection<Int>): Map<Int, MallProjection?> {
        val values = mallValkeyRepository.getAll(ids.toList())
        return ids.zip(values).associate {
            it.first to it.second?.toProjection()
        }
    }

    override fun putAll(values: Map<Int, MallProjection>) {
        mallValkeyRepository.putAll(values.map { (_, v) -> v.toEntity() })
    }
}
```

#### 3.2 CategoryRepository

**인터페이스** (`domain/proxy`):
```kotlin
interface CategoryRepository {
    fun getAllByIds(categoryIds: List<Int>): List<CategoryProjection>
    fun putAll(categories: List<CategoryProjection>)
}
```

**구현체** (`outbound-adapter/proxy/CategoryRepositoryImpl.kt`):
```kotlin
