### 4. Service 전체 코드

#### 4.1 MallApplicationService

**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/application/index/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/application/index/service/proxy/MallApplicationService.kt`

```kotlin
@Service
class MallApplicationService(
    private val mallProxyReader: MallProxyReader,
    private val mallRepository: MallRepository,
    mallGlobalCache: GlobalCache<Int, MallProjection>,
    localCacheProperties: LocalCacheProperties,
) {
    private val localCache = LocalCacheFactory.create<Int, MallProjection>(
        keyPrefix = LOCAL_CACHE_KEY_PREFIX,
        ttlSeconds = localCacheProperties.mall.ttlSeconds,
    )

    private val tieredCache = TieredLoadingCacheFactory.create(
        localCache = localCache,
        globalCache = mallGlobalCache,
        fetcher = { ids -> mallProxyReader.getAllByIds(ids.toList()).associateBy { it.mallId } },
    )

    fun getCachedAllByIds(ids: List<Int>): Map<Int, MallProjection> =
        tieredCache.getAll(ids)
            .filterValues { it != null }
            .mapValues { it.value!! }

    fun getAllByIds(ids: List<Int>): List<MallProjection> = mallRepository.getAllByIds(ids)

    companion object {
        const val LOCAL_CACHE_KEY_PREFIX = "local.search-api.mall"
    }
}
```

#### 4.2 CategoryApplicationService

**파일**: `/Users/admin/project/integrated-search/application/index/src/main/kotlin/com/cowave/search/application/index/service/proxy/CategoryApplicationService.kt`

```kotlin
@Service
class CategoryApplicationService(
    private val categoryProxyReader: CategoryProxyReader,
    private val categoryRepository: CategoryRepository,
    categoryGlobalCache: GlobalCache<Int, CategoryProjection>,
    localCacheProperties: LocalCacheProperties,
) {
    private val localCache =
        LocalCacheFactory.create<Int, CategoryProjection>(
            keyPrefix = LOCAL_CACHE_KEY_PREFIX,
            ttlSeconds = localCacheProperties.brand.ttlSeconds,  // 주의: "brand"로 설정됨
        )

    private val tieredCache =
        TieredLoadingCacheFactory.create(
            localCache = localCache,
            globalCache = categoryGlobalCache,
            fetcher = { ids -> categoryProxyReader.getAllByIds(ids.toList()).associateBy { it.id } },
        )

    fun getCachedAllByIds(ids: List<Int>): Map<Int, CategoryProjection> =
        tieredCache.getAll(ids)
            .filterValues { it != null }
            .mapValues { it.value!! }

    fun getAllByIds(ids: List<Int>): List<CategoryProjection> = categoryRepository.getAllByIds(ids)

    companion object {
        const val LOCAL_CACHE_KEY_PREFIX = "local.search-api.category"
    }
}
```

**주요 특징:**
- **계층적 캐시 구조**: Local Cache → Global Cache (Valkey) → ProxyReader (API)
- **Local Cache**: 애플리케이션 메모리 내 임시 캐시
- **Global Cache**: Valkey (Redis) 기반의 분산 캐시
- **ProxyReader**: 외부 API를 통해 데이터 조회

